  "contentHtml": "<p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">수업시간에 활용할 수 있도록 방탈출게임</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">금고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">버전을 추가로 개발했습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이번 버전에서는 번호를 숫자로 맞출 수도 있고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">주관식 문제를 내고 한글 초성을 숫자를 이용해 정답을 맞출 수도 있습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&nbsp; <span class=\"imageblock\" style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-image-outset: 0; border-image-repeat: stretch; border-image-slice: 100%; border-image-source: none; border-image-width: 1; border-left-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-left-style: solid; border-left-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-right-style: solid; border-right-width: 1px; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; display: inline-block; height: auto; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 5px; max-width: 100%; padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; padding-top: 5px; width: 630px;\"><img width=\"630\" height=\"378\" style=\"border-bottom-color: currentColor; border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-image-outset: 0; border-image-repeat: stretch; border-image-slice: 100%; border-image-source: none; border-image-width: 1; border-left-color: currentColor; border-left-style: none; border-left-width: 0px; border-right-color: currentColor; border-right-style: none; border-right-width: 0px; border-top-color: currentColor; border-top-style: none; border-top-width: 0px; cursor: pointer; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R1280x0/?scode=mtistory2&amp;fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile3.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99D853435D118F4C29029F\" filename=\"사용자 지정 2.png\" filemime=\"image/jpeg\"></span></p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이번 금고 버전에서는 무선키패드를 활용해 입력할 수 있도록 만들었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">교실 중간에 무선키패드를 설치해 놓으면 정답을 알아낸 모둠은 교실 중간에 와서 직접 비밀번호를 입력해서 성공여부를 확인해 볼 수 있습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">또는 성공한 모둠에 무선키패드를 주고 앞으로 나오지 않고 직접 입력하게 할 수도 있습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"clear: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); float: none; font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span class=\"imageblock\" style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-image-outset: 0; border-image-repeat: stretch; border-image-slice: 100%; border-image-source: none; border-image-width: 1; border-left-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-left-style: solid; border-left-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-right-style: solid; border-right-width: 1px; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; display: inline-block; height: auto; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 5px; max-width: 100%; padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; padding-top: 5px; width: 422px;\"><img width=\"422\" height=\"328\" style=\"border-bottom-color: currentColor; border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-image-outset: 0; border-image-repeat: stretch; border-image-slice: 100%; border-image-source: none; border-image-width: 1; border-left-color: currentColor; border-left-style: none; border-left-width: 0px; border-right-color: currentColor; border-right-style: none; border-right-width: 0px; border-top-color: currentColor; border-top-style: none; border-top-width: 0px; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R1280x0/?scode=mtistory2&amp;fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile27.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F993D683E5D121CC3205809\" filename=\"사용자 지정 1.png\" filemime=\"image/png\" \"\"=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><br>(무선키패드를 사용하게 하기 위해, 키패드에 있는 숫자만으로 모든걸 다 입력할 수 있게 했습니다. 확인도 마우스 사용하지 않고, 그냥 엔터키 눌러서 확인이 가능합니다.)</span></p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&nbsp; <span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">도전 횟수에 제한을 두면 정답을 다시 검증하고 모둠별로 신중하게 생각해서 입력하게 할 수 있습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&nbsp; <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&lt;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">수업시간 활용법</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&gt;</span></p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">객관식 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">문제를 모둠별로 주고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">문제를 다 푼 모둠은 정답 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개를 순서대로 방탈출게임 프로그램에 입력해서 비밀번호가 맞는지 확인해 보게 합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">주관식으로 문제를 출제하고 한글 정답의 초성을 숫자로 입력해서 비밀번호를 알아내게 합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"clear: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); float: none; font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span class=\"imageblock\" style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-image-outset: 0; border-image-repeat: stretch; border-image-slice: 100%; border-image-source: none; border-image-width: 1; border-left-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-left-style: solid; border-left-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-right-style: solid; border-right-width: 1px; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; display: inline-block; height: auto; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 5px; max-width: 100%; padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; padding-top: 5px; width: 562px;\"><img width=\"562\" height=\"349\" style=\"border-bottom-color: currentColor; border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-image-outset: 0; border-image-repeat: stretch; border-image-slice: 100%; border-image-source: none; border-image-width: 1; border-left-color: currentColor; border-left-style: none; border-left-width: 0px; border-right-color: currentColor; border-right-style: none; border-right-width: 0px; border-top-color: currentColor; border-top-style: none; border-top-width: 0px; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R1280x0/?scode=mtistory2&amp;fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile25.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99761F495D118EDD2B1A0A\" filename=\"사용자 지정 1.png\" filemime=\"image/jpeg\"></span></p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">예</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">과자 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">-&gt; </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">입력 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">19 [</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">엔터</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">] (</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">ㄱ</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">-&gt;1 , </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">ㅈ</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">-&gt;9 </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">로 입력</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">임의의 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">자리 숫자를 입력해 놓고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학생들이 돌아가면서 입력하게 하고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">입력 할 때 마다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">그 수보다 큰지 작은지를 알려주면서 선생님이 생각한 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">자리 번호를 맞추게 합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&nbsp; <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&lt;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">프로그램 사용법</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&gt;</span></p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">알아낸 비밀번호를 마우스로 누르거나 키보드의 숫자를 눌러 입력할 수 있습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">확인을 누르거나 엔터키를 치면 정답여부를 확인할 수 있습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">비밀모드에 체크해 놓으면 입력한 숫자가 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">* </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">표로 표시 됩니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">교단선진화를 통해 전체 학생에게 프로그램이 보여질 때</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">다른 모둠이 입력한 값을 참고할 수 없게 만들 때 비밀모드를 사용합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이때는 마우스를 이용하지 말고 키보드의 숫자판이나 키패드를 이용하여 입력하게 하는 것이 좋습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">한글에 체크를 하면 한글 초성을 숫자를 이용해서 입력할 수 있습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">간단한 단어나</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">문장을 알아낸 다음 숫자를 이용해서 입력하면 됩니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">5. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">비밀번호를 맞추었을 때 메시지를 보여줄 수도 있고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">꼭 보여주지 않아도 상관 없습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p><br style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">프로그램은 아래 링크에서 다운 받을 수 있습니다.&nbsp;<br style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">출처: </span><a style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-alig